    "title": "First Energy defends request for new gas fired plant at Fort Martin - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Lawrence ,\n9 hours ago CHARLESTON, W.Va. — First Energy continues to defend plans to build a gas fired power plant adjacent to a coal fired power plant in Monongalia County. Appearing on MetroNews Talkline Wednesday, First Energy President of Maryland and West Virginia operations, Chris Beam, said the company settled on a gas fired operation because it was the most feasible option for the future. Read full article",
